        def: 'An assessment a student takes to move up a rank. Kukkiwon describes its dan and poom promotion test as "a process that evaluates the technical and training level" of the student. Japanese arts often use the word shinsa for a rank examination; the All United States Kendo Federation uses it for its own exams. See our guide to <a href="/blog/belt-testing-how-often-what-to-charge/">how often to hold belt tests and what to charge</a>.',
