        id: 'belt-ladder', term: 'Belt ladder',
        def: 'The ordered list of belts or ranks a school uses, from beginner to black belt, with what is required at each step. Common usage. Schools in the same art often use different ladders.',
        src: [],
      },
      {
        id: 'ready-to-test', term: 'Ready-to-test list',
        def: 'The list of students who have met a school\'s minimum classes and time at their belt, and so can be assessed at the next test. Common usage. Being on the list makes a student eligible; it does not mean they pass.',
        src: [],
      },
    ],
  },
